{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The king has granted you a wasteland in the frontier as your fief. You must build and expand this fief from scratch, making it secure and prosperous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need to continually <u>recruit villagers</u>\u00a0and assign them jobs to develop your fief. Mind the growing food consumption as population increases, preventing famine in your domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When night falls, you must <u>defend against monster attacks from the deep forest</u>. The assaults will grow fiercer each night - ensure your fief doesn't fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thus, you must raise an army and <u>destroy the monsters' nest</u>\u00a0to achieve lasting peace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650650?t=1745553196","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650650?t=1745553196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/d0983067c207dc13e2a3443a8a881a96cf052aa1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745553196","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/d0983067c207dc13e2a3443a8a881a96cf052aa1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745553196","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The king has granted you a wasteland in the frontier as your fief. You must build and expand this fief from scratch, making it secure and prosperous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need to continually <u>recruit villagers</u>\u00a0and assign them jobs to develop your fief. Mind the growing food consumption as population increases, preventing famine in your domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When night falls, you must <u>defend against monster attacks from the deep forest</u>. The assaults will grow fiercer each night - ensure your fief doesn't fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thus, you must raise an army and <u>destroy the monsters' nest</u>\u00a0to achieve lasting peace.</p>","developers":["\u59da\u5b50\u8c6a"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650650/3131097960e9231609679d4c01e45956a6c5cf02/header.jpg?t=1745553196","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125749,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125749/movie480.mp4?t=1745553194","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125749/movie_max.mp4?t=1745553194"},"name":"DEMO","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125749/174b08cec306a145a99fe4db301b464543ee9986/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745553194","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125749/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745553194","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125749/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745553194"}}],"name":"Fief Lord","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  1Gb Video Memory, capable of OpenGL 3.0+ support (2.1 with ARB extensions acceptable)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u59da\u5b50\u8c6a"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{